},"isUserAdmin":false,"organisation":{"id":627,"name":"Indraprastha Institute of Information Technology (IIIT), Delhi","description":"<ul>\n<li>Indraprastha Institute of Information Technology, Delhi (IIIT-Delhi or IIIT-D) was established with the status of State University by an act of Delhi Government (The IIIT Delhi Act,2007).<\/li>\n<li>The institute has gained an excellent reputation in India and abroad over a span of a few years.<\/li>\n<li>Since its establishment in 2008, the institute has grown to be recognized as one of the country&rsquo;s most promising young institutions for education and research in India.<\/li>\n<li>The institute has been accorded 12-B status by the University Grants Commission (UGC).<\/li>\n<li>The institute is accredited &lsquo;A&rsquo; grade by NAAC<\/li>\n<li>The permanent campus of the institute is at Okhla having art infrastructure and all the modern facilities.<\/li>\n<li>The Institute is continuously moving forward as a community, keeping in mind the need for sustainability and transformation and thus becoming a globally respected and recognized institution.<\/li>\n<li>The institute nurture and train intellectually capable, innovative and entrepreneurial professionals so that they can work towards serving the nation and society.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","public_url":"c\/indraprastha-institute-of-information-technology-iiit-delhi-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-627","logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners75\/5d31763067ef6_IIIT_Delhi_logo.jpg","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners125\/5d31763067ef6_IIIT_Delhi_logo.jpg","organisation_type":"3","wp_tag":null,"seo_url":"https:\/\/unstop.com\/c\/indraprastha-institute-of-information-technology-iiit-delhi-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-627","website":"https:\/\/www.iiitd.ac.in\/","extra_fields":"{\"industry\":\"\",\"industry_url\":\"\",\"founder\":\"\",\"foundedOn\":\